(Section 2: High-Dimensional Dense Vector Embeddings) '
(We evaluate text-embedding-004 generating 768-dimensional normalized unit vectors.) '
(Cosine similarity measures the orientation between query vectors and document chunk vectors.) '
(When combined with lexical keyword weighting \(BM25-lite bonus of 0.15\), retrieval precision) '
(increases by 14.3% compared to pure dense search alone.) '
() '
(Key Finding on Page 2:) '
(The hybrid retrieval strategy eliminates false positive matches on technical acronyms.) '
(Total indexing latency per 100-page document remains under 4.2 seconds.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
